<tr><th style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; text-align:left; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; width:34%;">카메라</th><td style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28; vertical-align:top;">광각 50MP 1/0.98″ · 중망원 70mm 50MP · 망원 252mm 50MP (최대 176× 하이브리드 줌)</td></tr>
